"A3":{"warm":"<div class=\"textpv\" style=\"background:#fff;color:#0b2a3c\"><div class=\"hl\" style=\"font-family:var(--display)\">Mangroves are nurseries for the reef.</div><div style=\"font-size:13.5px\">Young snapper hide among mangrove roots before moving out to the reef. Lose the mangroves and the reef loses its next generation. Here’s what we’re measuring, and what you can do with it.</div></div>","inst":"<div class=\"textpv\" style=\"background:#fff;color:#0b2a3c\"><div class=\"hl\" style=\"font-family:var(--display)\">Ecosystem connectivity as a determinant of seascape functioning</div><div style=\"font-size:13.5px\">The SEASTRONG project investigates multidirectional connectivity pathways between mangrove forests, seagrass beds and coral reefs in order to inform integrated management.</div></div>","urgent":"<div class=\"textpv\" style=\"background:#fff;color:#0b2a3c\"><div class=\"hl\" style=\"font-family:var(--display)\">Our coasts are running out of time.</div><div style=\"font-size:13.5px\">Every mangrove cut is a reef starved. Climate change is accelerating, and the window to act is closing. Join the fight for connected coasts.</div></div>","play":"<div class=\"textpv\" style=\"background:#fff;color:#0b2a3c\"><div class=\"hl\" style=\"font-family:var(--display)\">Ever wondered where reef fish go to kindergarten?</div><div style=\"font-size:13.5px\">Spoiler: it’s the mangroves. Tiny snapper spend their childhood dodging predators among the roots, then graduate to the reef.</div></div>"},
